Package: TConstrain
Title: Topology-Constrained Trajectory Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Xianzhe", "Hu", email = "xianzhe88888@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Constructs cluster-level trajectory trees with exact topological
    constraints or a normalized probabilistic model. Gaussian coordinate
    likelihoods and edge-factorized tree priors yield maximum a posteriori
    trees, exact edge marginals and conditional model evidence using the
    matrix-tree theorem. Supports independent temporal gap supervision and
    auditable hard and soft rules for single-cell topology exploration.
